{
  "title": "Mini-JV",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Roland JV-880 PCM",
        "synthesizer emulator.",
        "",
        "28-voice polyphony.",
        "192 factory patches",
        "(Preset A, B, and",
        "Internal banks).",
        "",
        "Two modes:",
        " Patch: single sound",
        "  with 4-tone edit",
        " Performance: 8 parts",
        "  on channels 1-8",
        "",
        "Supports SR-JV80",
        "expansion ROMs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Setup",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "ROM Files",
          "lines": [
            "Requires JV-880",
            "v1.0.0 ROM files in",
            "the roms/ folder:",
            "",
            " jv880_rom1.bin",
            " jv880_rom2.bin",
            " jv880_waverom1.bin",
            " jv880_waverom2.bin",
            "",
            "Upload via the ME",
            "Installer's asset",
            "copy feature.",
            "",
            "v1.0.1 ROMs do NOT",
            "work (CPU traps)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Expansion ROMs",
          "lines": [
            "Optional SR-JV80",
            "expansion cards.",
            "",
            "Place .bin files in",
            "roms/expansions/",
            "",
            "Files must have",
            "\"SR-JV80\" in the",
            "filename.",
            "",
            "Auto-unscrambled on",
            "first load. Patches",
            "appear after the",
            "192 factory sounds.",
            "",
            "Up to 32 expansions."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Patch Mode",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Navigation",
          "lines": [
            "Jog: browse patches",
            "L/R: prev/next",
            "Shift+L/R: next bank",
            "",
            "Banks:",
            " Preset A (0-63)",
            " Preset B (64-127)",
            " Internal (128-191)",
            " Expansions (192+)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Knobs (Patch)",
          "lines": [
            "In the shadow UI the",
            "8 knobs are:",
            "",
            "1 Cutoff",
            "2 Resonance",
            "3 Attack",
            "4 Decay",
            "5 Sustain",
            "6 Release",
            "7 Filter Env",
            "8 LFO Depth",
            "",
            "These are macros: one",
            "knob moves the same",
            "parameter on every",
            "tone at once.",
            "",
            "OVERLAY KNOBS ARE",
            "NOT THE SAME EIGHT.",
            "With the shadow UI",
            "hidden you get:",
            "",
            "1 Cutoff",
            "2 Resonance",
            "3 Attack",
            "4 Decay",
            "5 Release",
            "6 Filter Env",
            "7 Reverb",
            "8 Chorus",
            "",
            "Sustain and LFO",
            "Depth are not on the",
            "overlay; Reverb and",
            "Chorus are not on",
            "the grid.",
            "",
            "Patch Level and Pan",
            "live under Common /",
            "Control."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tone Editing",
          "lines": [
            "Each patch has 4",
            "tones (layers).",
            "",
            "Track 1-4 buttons:",
            " Select tone 1-4",
            "",
            "Shift+Track:",
            " Mute/unmute tone",
            "",
            "Knob edits apply to",
            "the selected tone.",
            "",
            "Each tone has its",
            "own filter, amp",
            "envelope, LFO, and",
            "wave settings."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Performance Mode",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Navigation",
          "lines": [
            "48 performances",
            "(3 banks x 16).",
            "",
            "Jog: browse",
            "Step 1-8: select",
            " part 1-8",
            "Shift+Step:",
            " mute/unmute part"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Knobs (Perf)",
          "lines": [
            "Performance mode",
            "edits one PART at a",
            "time.",
            "Open Parts and pick",
            "the part first.",
            "",
            "1 Level",
            "2 Pan",
            "3 Reverb",
            "4 Chorus",
            "5 Coarse Tune",
            "  transpose, semis",
            "6 Fine Tune",
            "  detune, cents",
            "7 Key Lo",
            "8 Key Hi",
            "  the key range",
            "",
            "The overlay knobs are",
            "the same eight in",
            "performance mode.",
            "",
            "Vel Sense and Vel Max",
            "are NOT knobs. They",
            "are on the Parts",
            "page below the eight,",
            "along with Part",
            "Switch, Bank, Patch",
            "and Key Transpose."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "In a Chain Slot",
          "lines": [
            "Picking Performance",
            "on the Mode page",
            "swaps the pages for",
            "the performance set:",
            "",
            "Presets: the 48",
            " performances",
            "Common / Effects:",
            " key mode + the",
            " PERFORMANCE reverb",
            " and chorus (not",
            " the patch's)",
            "Edit Parts: pick a",
            " part, then level,",
            " pan, tune, key",
            " range, velocity,",
            " its patch, and",
            " Part On",
            "Save to Slot: write",
            " to one of the 16",
            " Internal slots",
            "Load Expansion",
            "",
            "Patch pages (tones,",
            "macros) are hidden",
            "here - they edit a",
            "patch, and a",
            "performance plays",
            "eight of them."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "28-voice polyphony.",
        "",
        "Patch Mode:",
        " All 16 channels",
        "",
        "Performance Mode:",
        " Parts on ch 1-8",
        "",
        "Octave Transpose:",
        " -4 to +4 via menu",
        "",
        "Supports velocity,",
        "pitch bend, and CCs."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
